                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]\"Hunting in an empty labrinth\"[/h1]\nSomehow this F2P game is a boring minigame. Tho it has cool pixel sprite graphics and a mysterious soundtrack the gameplay is just focussed on cutdown medusa's head. Hiding behind a couple of columns and waiting for her to pass through. It is even topped by a brainless achievement: to beat the devs record of 42 secs. Who cares? If you run around in an empty labrinth with medusa's spawntimes of 2-3 secs and can hurt her 20% with one hit you've finally become the lucky bostard who everybody hates.",
